OL,3,AVictims in rape cases must not feel
OL,4,Alike they are on trial, Burnham says
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndy Burnham has said the government
OL,7,Fneeds to make sure that victims in rape
OL,8,Fcases do not feel like they are on
OL,9,Ftrial.
OL,11,FHis comments come after Metropolitan
OL,12,FPolice boss Sir Mark Rowley told the
OL,13,FBBC that what he heard reported from
OL,14,FRussell Brand's trial came very close
OL,15,Fto "victim blaming".
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
